/*!
    \page intro
    \title QML Dot Path Links
    \brief A page that documents QML dot-path links without a QML context.

    Module-qualified dot-path links:
    \list
    \li \l TestModule.Layout.fillHeight
    \li \l TestModule.Layout
    \li \l TestModule.Layout.DragMode
    \li \l TestModule.Layout.values.integer
    \li \l TestModule.Panel
    \endlist

    Names that are not QML dot paths: a protocol URL and a
    file name. The notes page's title contains a dot and a
    space, so the bare title is not a QML dot path; the page
    is linked by its title in braces:
    \list
    \li \l https://doc.qt.io/qt-6/
    \li \l layout.intro.html
    \li \l {Layout.fillHeight notes}
    \endlist

    Ordinary autolinks: Panel and OtherModule.Layout.
*/
